guide forever/horde/30-40/02-stranglethorn-vale
title Stranglethorn Vale
faction Horde
levels 32-35
zone Stranglethorn Vale
next forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale

# Consensus route (Horde Tauren export), visit 24 part 1/3 (Stranglethorn
# Vale 32.9-34.4), plus the export's earlier Stranglethorn stop (visit 17,
# level 30.4), shared by every Horde start.
#
# Flow: the Undercity (where the previous guide ends) -> zeppelin to Grom'gol
# (flight path, bind) -> Nesingwary's camp -> young tigers and panthers ->
# Nesingwary -> tigers, panthers, raptors and the Bloodscalp trolls ->
# Nesingwary -> elder tigers and Lashtail raptors -> Grom'gol -> Nesingwary
# and Sin'Dall -> the Bloodscalp village -> hearth to Grom'gol -> the road
# south to Booty Bay (flight path) -> fly to Grom'gol -> the river, the
# basilisks and the Bloodscalp village -> Grom'gol -> fly to Booty Bay -> fly
# to Grom'gol -> Lashtail raptors -> Mosh'Ogg, Shadowmaw and the Snapjaw
# river -> Grom'gol, where the next guide starts.
#
# Optional extras: Crystal in the Mountains (635) starts from the Pendant of
# Myzrael, a 0.01-0.08% drop from the trolls; take it only if one drops (it
# ends in Arathi).
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Welcome to the Jungle (583), Tiger Mastery (185) and Panther Mastery
#   (190) come from the export's first Stranglethorn stop at 30.4, merged
#   here: the same camp, without the zeppelin round trip from Orgrimmar. The
#   Booty Bay flight path from that stop is taken on the first Booty Bay
#   visit.
# - One Grom'gol bind for the whole visit: the export's Booty Bay binds are
#   each replaced before use. The second hearth is replaced by the short
#   ride from the Bloodscalp village to Grom'gol.
# - Some Assembly Required (577): accepted and its skins gathered here, but
#   handed in on the Booty Bay stop of 04-stranglethorn-vale instead of an
#   extra Grom'gol-Booty Bay round trip.
#
# Class quests: none on this stretch.
#
# Carried on: Trollbane (638) for Arathi; Bloody Bone Necklaces (596) and The
# Vile Reef (629) for the next guide; Some Assembly Required (577) for
# 04-stranglethorn-vale.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Grom'gol

step Zeppelin to Grom'gol
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Leave the Undercity by the lift and walk up through the ruins to the zeppelin towers; the Grom'gol zeppelin is the one on the south-west tower.
  goto 61.8,59.2 "Zeppelin towers"

step Grom'gol Base Camp
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The zeppelin lands at the tower on the west side of the camp.
  getfp "Grom'gol" npc 1387           -- Thysta
  sethome "Grom'gol" npc 5814         -- Innkeeper Thulbek
  turnin 1240                         -- Kin'weelay
  accept 581                          -- Nimboya

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Nesingwary's camp

step Nesingwary's camp
  tip Follow the road north out of Grom'gol; Nesingwary's hunting camp sits on the hill north-east of the river. From here on, keep every page of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn you loot: Barnil asks for them later.
  accept 583                          -- Barnil Stonepot
  turnin 583                          -- Hemet Nesingwary
  turnin 5762
  turnin 5763
  accept 194
  accept 185                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  accept 190                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin

step Young tigers and panthers
  tip Young Stranglethorn Tigers prowl west of the camp, Young Panthers south and east of it.
  goto 33.0,11.0 "Around Nesingwary's camp"
  kill 681 quest 185
  kill 683 quest 190

step Nesingwary's camp
  turnin 185                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  accept 186
  turnin 190                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin
  accept 191

step Tigers and panthers
  tip Stranglethorn Tigers and Panthers (32-33) roam the hills east of the camp, along the lake shore.
  goto 43.3,19.6 "East of the camp"
  kill 682 quest 186
  kill 736 quest 191

step Raptors and the Bloodscalp trolls
  tip Head west past the camp. Stranglethorn Raptors (33-34) hunt the clearings, and the Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins on the coast: every Bloodscalp can drop a tusk. A Pendant of Myzrael is a very rare drop from them: if one drops, read it.
  goto 26.0,16.0 "Bloodscalp ruins"
  kill 685 quest 194
  collect 3901 quest 581
  collect 4614 x1 optional
  accept 635 optional

step Nesingwary's camp
  turnin 186                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  accept 187
  turnin 191                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin
  turnin 194                          -- Hemet Nesingwary
  accept 195

step Elder tigers and Lashtail raptors
  tip The Elder Stranglethorn Tigers (34-35) roam the hills south-west of the camp; the Lashtail Raptors (35-36) hunt further south, towards Grom'gol.
  goto 33.4,18.5 "Elder tiger hills"
  kill 1085 quest 187
  kill 686 quest 195

step Grom'gol
  tip Follow the road south to Grom'gol.
  turnin 581                          -- Nimboya
  accept 582

step Nesingwary's camp
  tip Back north to the camp.
  turnin 195                          -- Hemet Nesingwary
  turnin 187                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  accept 188

step Sin'Dall
  tip Sin'Dall, a level 37 tiger, prowls the hilltop south-west of the camp.
  collect 3879 quest 188 @31.8,16.4

step Nesingwary's camp
  turnin 188                          -- Ajeck Rouack

step Bloodscalp headhunters
  tip The Bloodscalp Headhunters (36-37) in the village on the coast carry the shrunken heads.
  goto 23.0,12.0 "Bloodscalp village"
  collect 1532 quest 582

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Booty Bay

step Hearth to Grom'gol
  hearth "Grom'gol"
  turnin 582                          -- Nimboya

step Booty Bay
  tip Follow the road south to Booty Bay at the southern tip of the vale and enter through the tunnel in the cliffs. Stay on the road: the jungle beside it is well above your level. Gringer, the Horde flight master, waits on the upper deck.
  getfp "Booty Bay" npc 2858          -- Gringer
  accept 189                          -- Kebok
  accept 201                          -- Krazek
  accept 605                          -- Crank Fizzlebub
  accept 575                          -- Drizzlik
  vendor nearest

step Fly to Grom'gol
  fly "Grom'gol"                      -- Gringer

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The north again

step The camp by the river
  tip Krazek's missing hunters' camp is Nesingwary's: walk among its tents and the investigation completes. River Crocolisks lie along the river below the camp.
  complete 201
  goto 37.4,11.1 "River below the camp"
  collect 4053 quest 575

step Basilisks and the Bloodscalp village
  tip West past the camp, Crystal Spine Basilisks (34-35) sit on the rocks; every Bloodscalp in the village beyond can drop an ear.
  goto 23.0,12.0 "Bloodscalp village"
  collect 3918 quest 605
  collect 1519 quest 189

step Fly to Booty Bay
  tip Ride south down the coast to Grom'gol and fly to Booty Bay.
  fly "Booty Bay"                     -- Thysta
  turnin 575                          -- Drizzlik
  accept 577
  turnin 605                          -- Crank Fizzlebub
  turnin 201                          -- Krazek
  turnin 189                          -- Kebok

step Fly to Grom'gol
  fly "Grom'gol"                      -- Gringer
  accept 568                          -- Commander Aggro'gosh
  accept 570                          -- Far Seer Mok'thardin
  accept 638                          -- Nimboya: for Arathi, later on the route
  accept 596                          -- Kin'weelay
  accept 629

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Raptors, Mosh'Ogg, Shadowmaw

step Lashtail raptors
  tip The Lashtail Raptors (35-36) hunt the jungle just north-east of Grom'gol.
  goto 35.3,23.5 "North-east of Grom'gol"
  kill 686 quest 568

step Commander Aggro'gosh
  turnin 568
  accept 569

step Mosh'Ogg camp
  tip The Mosh'Ogg ogres camp in the hills just east of Grom'gol. Kill one Brute and one Witch Doctor (36-37); pull them one at a time.
  goto 37.0,31.0 "Mosh'Ogg camp"
  kill 1142 quest 569.1
  kill 1144 quest 569.2

step Shadowmaw jungle and the Snapjaw river
  tip East of the ogres, Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) stalk unseen until they strike; the Stranglethorn Tigresses roam the same ground and now and then drop a pristine fang. Snapjaw Crocolisks line the river just west of the jungle; keep their skins for Drizzlik.
  goto 42.4,32.5 "Shadowmaw jungle"
  collect 3838 quest 570.1
  collect 3839 quest 570.2
  collect 4104 quest 577 @39.9,28.4

step Grom'gol
  tip Back to Grom'gol; the next guide starts here.
  turnin 569                          -- Commander Aggro'gosh
  turnin 570                          -- Far Seer Mok'thardin
  vendor nearest
